    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With »pilot 4.0«, you define all the steps that »roboSet 2« should carry out for the next jobs. The software also impresses with intuitive operation, clear menus, large buttons and a customizable interface. You can plan and start tool inspections quickly and document data easily.</p>",
